        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>2024·美的集团ESG报告 - 附录二</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n  </script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\n    body{\n      margin:0;\n      background:#fff;\n      font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"PingFang SC\",Arial,sans-serif;\n      color:#888;\n    }\n    .page{\n      width:1132px;\n      height:768px;\n      margin:0 auto;\n      padding:38px 54px 25px;\n      position:relative;\n      overflow:hidden;\n    }\n    .topbar{\n      height:54px;\n      font-size:8px;\n      color:#9b9b9b;\n      display:flex;\n      justify-content:space-between;\n      align-items:flex-start;\n    }\n    .report-name{font-size:9px}\n    .nav{\n      display:flex;\n      gap:20px;\n      align-items:center;\n      white-space:nowrap;\n    }\n    .appendix{\n      color:#008fd3;\n      border:1px solid #008fd3;\n      border-radius:10px;\n      padding:1px 5px;\n      line-height:12px;\n    }\n    h1{\n      font-size:20px;\n      font-weight:500;\n      color:#0096dc;\n      margin:22px 0 21px;\n      line-height:1;\n    }\n    .legend{\n      position:absolute;\n      right:54px;\n      top:129px;\n      height:18px;\n      display:flex;\n      align-items:center;\n      gap:8px;\n      padding:0 10px;\n      background:#f2f2f2;\n      border-radius:12px;\n      font-size:9px;\n      color:#999;\n    }\n    .legend .clock,\n    .clock{\n      width:13px;\n      height:13px;\n      border-radius:50%;\n      display:inline-flex;\n      justify-content:center;\n      align-items:center;\n      font-size:10px;\n      font-weight:bold;\n      background:#fff;\n      border:1px solid currentColor;\n      line-height:1;\n    }\n    .short{color:#ff8568}\n    .medium{color:#a4aeb1}\n    .long{color:#35c880}\n    .content{\n      display:grid;\n      grid-template-columns:459px 459px;\n      column-gap:107px;\n      align-items:start;\n    }\n    .column{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px}\n    .row{\n      height:36px;\n      border:1px solid #39abe3;\n      border-radius:19px 0 0 19px;\n      overflow:hidden;\n      display:grid;\n      grid-template-columns:31px 350px 77px;\n      align-items:stretch;\n      background:white;\n    }\n    .right .row{grid-template-columns:76px 350px 31px;border-radius:0 19px 19px 0}\n    .desc{\n      padding:5px 3px 3px 1px;\n      font-size:9px;\n      line-height:12px;\n      color:#888;\n      overflow:hidden;\n    }\n    .topic{\n      background:#0098d9;\n      color:#fff;\n      font-size:10px;\n      line-height:12px;\n      display:flex;\n      align-items:center;\n      padding:3px 8px;\n      font-weight:500;\n    }\n    .left .topic{padding-left:9px}\n    .iconbox{\n      display:flex;\n      align-items:center;\n      justify-content:center;\n      background:#fff;\n    }\n    .bottomnote{\n      position:absolute;\n      bottom:38px;\n      left:620px;\n      font-size:7px;\n      color:#aaa;\n      white-space:nowrap;\n    }\n    .page-no{\n      position:absolute;\n      bottom:25px;\n      font-size:9px;\n      color:#666;\n    }\n    .left-no{left:54px}\n    .right-no{right:54px}\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"topbar\">\n      <div class=\"report-name\">2024 · 美的集团ESG报告</div>\n      <div class=\"nav\">\n        <span>关于本报告</span><span>走进美的</span><span>可持续发展治理</span><span>守护蓝色星球</span>\n        <span>构建和谐社区</span><span>践行科技尽善</span><span>共创繁荣生态</span><span class=\"appendix\">附录</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <h1>附录二 可持续发展相关风险和机遇</h1>\n\n    <div class=\"legend\">\n      <span>时间期限24：</span>\n      <span class=\"clock short\">◔</span><span>短期</span>\n      <span class=\"clock medium\">◔</span><span>中期</span>\n      <span class=\"clock long\">◔</span><span>长期</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"column left\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div class=\"iconbox\"><span class=\"clock short\">◔</span></div>\n          <div class=\"desc\">企业应建立完善的环保管理体系，加强环境监测和评估，确保生产活动符合相关环保要求，从而降低环境风险和运营成本。</div>\n          <div class=\"topic\">环境<br>与治理</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div class=\"iconbox\"><span class=\"clock short\">◔</span></div>\n          <div class=\"desc\">企业应尊重员工权益，提供平等的工作机会和福利待遇，建立包容性的企业文化，通过吸引和留住来自不同背景的人才，增强创新能力。</div>\n          <div class=\"topic\">员工权益与<br>多元化</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div class=\"iconbox\"><span class=\"clock medium\">◔</span></div>\n          <div class=\"desc\">企业应建立完善的网络安全防护体系，加强数据管理和监控，确保客户数据的安全和隐私。</div>\n          <div class=\"topic\">数据安全与<br>客户隐私保护</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div class=\"iconbox\"><span class=\"clock short\">◔</span></div>\n          <div class=\"desc\">企业应加强对供应链中冲突矿产的监控和管理，确保采购的矿产来自合法和可持续的来源，避免出现相关事件的负面声誉与财务影响。</div>\n          <div class=\"topic\">冲突<br>矿产管理</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div class=\"iconbox\"><span class=\"clock medium\">◔</span></div>\n          <div class=\"desc\">企业应加强对水资源的管理和监控，采用节水技术和工艺，并通过推动水资源循环利用和节水文化建设，降低水资源消耗、污染和利用成本。</div>\n          <div class=\"topic\">可持续<br>水资源管理</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div class=\"iconbox\"><span class=\"clock short\">◔</span></div>\n          <div class=\"desc\">企业应建立健全的反腐败机制，加强员工教育和培训，确保经营活动的合规性和透明度。</div>\n          <div class=\"topic\">反商业贿赂及<br>反污行</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div class=\"iconbox\"><span class=\"clock short\">◔</span></div>\n          <div class=\"desc\">企业在推广产品或服务时，必须遵循真实、准确、透明的原则，避免夸大其词或误导消费者，从而确保企业正面形象。</div>\n          <div class=\"topic\">负责任营销与<br>宣传</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div class=\"iconbox\"><span class=\"clock long\">◔</span></div>\n          <div class=\"desc\">高效利用能源不仅可以降低企业的运营成本，提高生产效率，还有助于减少对环境的影响。</div>\n          <div class=\"topic\">能源利用</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div class=\"iconbox\"><span class=\"clock medium\">◔</span></div>\n          <div class=\"desc\">企业应坚决抵制虚假宣传、恶意降价、商业贿赂等不正当竞争行为，通过合法合规的经营方式，树立行业标杆，推动整个行业的健康发展。</div>\n          <div class=\"topic\">反不当竞争</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div class=\"iconbox\"><span class=\"clock short\">◔</span></div>\n          <div class=\"desc\">企业应严格遵守环保法规，加强污染治理，减少污染物排放，保护生态环境。</div>\n          <div class=\"topic\">污染物排放</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div class=\"iconbox\"><span class=\"clock long\">◔</span></div>\n          <div class=\"desc\">企业应积极参与社会公益活动，通过捐赠资金、物资、技术支持等方式回馈社会，帮助弱势群体，促进社会和谐稳定。</div>\n          <div class=\"topic\">社会贡献</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div class=\"iconbox\"><span class=\"clock long\">◔</span></div>\n          <div class=\"desc\">企业应强化知识产权保护，维护合法权益，同时尊重他人知识产权，通过完善管理制度激励创新活力，助力技术进步与产业升级。</div>\n          <div class=\"topic\">知识产权保护</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"column right\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div class=\"topic\">应对气候变化</div>\n          <div class=\"desc\">随着全球气候变化的日益严峻，企业可通过采用可再生能源、提高能源利用效率、推行绿色产品和服务等方式，积极应对减缓气候变化的影响。</div>\n          <div class=\"iconbox\"><span class=\"clock long\">◔</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div class=\"topic\">创新与研发</div>\n          <div class=\"desc\">通过不断探索新技术、新产品和新服务，企业可以保持竞争优势，满足消费者不断变化的需求。同时，研发投资也可能带来财务投入和潜在风险。</div>\n          <div class=\"iconbox\"><span class=\"clock long\">◔</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div class=\"topic\">产品质量与<br>安全</div>\n          <div class=\"desc\">确保产品符合标准法规，是企业保护消费者的底线。企业需完善质量管理体系，强化检测监控，保障产品质量稳定。</div>\n          <div class=\"iconbox\"><span class=\"clock long\">◔</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div class=\"topic\">供应链管理与<br>安全</div>\n          <div class=\"desc\">有效的供应链管理可以降低生产成本，供应链的稳定性和可靠性可以防范潜在的风险和中断，企业需要加强供应链管理。</div>\n          <div class=\"iconbox\"><span class=\"clock long\">◔</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div class=\"topic\">员工健康与<br>安全</div>\n          <div class=\"desc\">企业应提供安全的工作环境，加强员工健康管理和培训，确保员工免受伤害。健康的员工队伍可以提高工作效率，为企业创造更多价值。</div>\n          <div class=\"iconbox\"><span class=\"clock short\">◔</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div class=\"topic\">循环经济与<br>废弃物管理</div>\n          <div class=\"desc\">企业循环利用资源、减少废弃物产生并妥善处置，既能降低环境负担、提升资源利用效率，又能借循环经济与绿色生产模式开拓新商机与市场空间。</div>\n          <div class=\"iconbox\"><span class=\"clock long\">◔</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div class=\"topic\">公司治理</div>\n          <div class=\"desc\">企业应完善治理结构与内控机制，保障决策科学透明合规，深化与股东、投资者及利益相关者的沟通协作，夯实信任基础，提升企业形象声誉。</div>\n          <div class=\"iconbox\"><span class=\"clock short\">◔</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div class=\"topic\">员工培训与<br>发展</div>\n          <div class=\"desc\">通过提供培训和发展机会，企业可以激发员工潜能，提升其工作效率和生产力，为企业创造更多价值。</div>\n          <div class=\"iconbox\"><span class=\"clock medium\">◔</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div class=\"topic\">消费者权益</div>\n          <div class=\"desc\">企业应关注消费者需求，不断精进产品和服务，满足消费者不断变化的需求，提升品牌形象和市场份额。</div>\n          <div class=\"iconbox\"><span class=\"clock short\">◔</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div class=\"topic\">股东权益</div>\n          <div class=\"desc\">企业应确保股东利益得到充分保障，通过建立良好的治理结构、透明的信息披露和合理的股利分配机制，深化股东沟通合作，提升投资者信心。</div>\n          <div class=\"iconbox\"><span class=\"clock medium\">◔</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div class=\"topic\">促进产业发展</div>\n          <div class=\"desc\">企业应积极参与行业交流与合作，通过分享经验、整合资源、协同合作等方式，共同推动技术创新和产业升级，实现互利共赢。</div>\n          <div class=\"iconbox\"><span class=\"clock long\">◔</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div class=\"topic\">生物多样性<br>保护</div>\n          <div class=\"desc\">企业应积极采取措施，保护生态环境和生物多样性，避免对生态系统造成破坏。</div>\n          <div class=\"iconbox\"><span class=\"clock long\">◔</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bottomnote\">* 绿色典型风险和机遇划分为：短期（0-1年）；中期（1-5年）；长期（5年以上）。</div>\n    <div class=\"page-no left-no\">141</div>\n    <div class=\"page-no right-no\">142</div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
